cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use or refer to AdvanDEB, please cite it using these metadata.
  AdvanDEB is funded by the Croatian Science Foundation (Hrvatska zaklada za
  znanost, HRZZ) under project IP-2024-05-3615-AdvanDEB.
type: software
title: "AdvanDEB: a curated knowledge graph and AI research assistant for Dynamic Energy Budget biology"
abstract: >-
  AdvanDEB ingests scientific literature, extracts factual claims, links them
  to a backbone of stylized facts and to an NCBI/GBIF taxonomy, and lets
  researchers explore the result as an interactive graph or through a chat
  assistant whose answers carry citations and a provenance trail. It also
  includes a transport-network DEB (tDEB) simulator and an expert-elicitation
  workflow for judging stylized facts against literature evidence. Funded by
  the Croatian Science Foundation (HRZZ), project IP-2024-05-3615-AdvanDEB.
authors:
  - family-names: Hackenberger
    given-names: Domagoj K.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AdvanDEB/advandeb"
url: "https://advandeb.com"
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - Dynamic Energy Budget
  - DEB theory
  - stylized facts
  - knowledge graph
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - expert elicitation
